### Official Score Tracking

> [!NOTE]
> The competition portal doesn't have an API — scores are displayed on a web dashboard. The workflow for tracking official scores is:
>
> 1. After submitting, the `submission_log.yaml` entry is created with `official_scores.status: "pending"`
> 2. When results appear on the portal, you tell me the scores and I update `submission_log.yaml`
> 3. Alternatively, I can use the browser tool to check the portal dashboard if you provide login credentials — but this may not be practical given auth requirements
>
> The key insight: **local scores should closely match official scores** since the eval container is the same. Any discrepancy indicates an environment issue worth investigating.

